  "action_semantics": "Every indexed intent is legal for a live capable role, even when its spatial/resource precondition fails; failed intents become deterministic no-ops. Out-of-range actions become wait. Terminal roles, and temporarily/incapacitated roles where specified, retain wait only. Masks do not leak private feasibility.",
  "joint_movement_semantics": "Targets outside the map, duplicate requested destinations, or another role current cell are rejected. No swaps or following into a just-vacated occupied cell occur in that transition.",
  "randomness": "reset first calls keys = jax.random.split(key, 2), then draws part_defect with randint(keys[0], (6,), 0, 2, dtype=int32) and order_color with randint(keys[1], (3,), 0, 2, dtype=int32). raw_step is deterministic and does not use its supplied key."
}
